{"id":"memorial_105202","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial105200","label":"Data · Tower to the Gods?.txt"},"label":"002.txt","stage":null,"prev":"memorial_105201","next":"memorial_105203","speakers":{},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_105202_1","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_52_02_description","text":"Today, the government dropped some shocking news."},{"id":"memorial_105202_2","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_52_02_description","text":"The site I've been investigating is apparently where they're building a lift for humanity's push into outer space."},{"id":"memorial_105202_3","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_52_02_description","text":"So far, they've only revealed one thing: Missilis Industry is leading the project, with government backing."},{"id":"memorial_105202_4","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_52_02_description","text":"But something doesn't add up. There's no mention of V.T.C. anywhere."},{"id":"memorial_105202_5","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_52_02_description","text":"And yet, I've seen people tied to V.T.C. going in and out of that site."},{"id":"memorial_105202_6","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_52_02_description","text":"So why leave them out?"},{"id":"memorial_105202_7","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_52_02_description","text":"... Why? I can't stop thinking about it!"},{"id":"memorial_105202_8","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_52_02_description","text":"There's only so much I can learn from the outside."},{"id":"memorial_105202_9","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_52_02_description","text":"Is there any way to get inside that construction site myself?"},{"id":"memorial_105202_10","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_52_02_description","text":"... I'll figure something out."}]}